<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling stable against dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling stable against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling remained virtually unchanged against the dollar on Wednesday exchanging at a commercial mean of 590.8815 shilling compared to Tuesday's mean of 590.8617, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Against sterling, the local shilling appreciated slightly exchanging for 918.2328 from Tuesday's mean of 920.5655.</p>
<p>Dealers said trading was slow due to an excess of dollars in the marketplace.</p>
